{"title":"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> has angles that measure <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/d/08d5c45388de5c75af641c046d466de3592ffa98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/0/620cfeb56e4f3387948ca6aba0d437d71508d5a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5x)^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"43\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/c/b4c551764ad02b349814b60ff1cd7cca3efc8b06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3x)^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"43\" height=\"20\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the interior angles of any triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0cd95f95238159d02dbcea0aca632c2928991c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/d/d2d64aca7484c7746d3bd099cffa1d599fc0c250.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60 + 5x + 3x = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"155\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/6/c562617d5850e244cf3d1cae64cb7e09d1a7d0ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8x + 60 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/9/21947d17e188e992f711186e7dc7549bdc5243bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8x = 180 - 60 = 120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"165\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/4/a14df72c14000e2176f9033014feb22499be28c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{120}{8} = \\boxed{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"121\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC\" title=\"2018 CIMC\">2018 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018061917\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 102/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1656/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 143/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1816/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.662      1 -total\n 51.73%    7.068      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n 40.33%    5.510      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37094:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018061917 and revision id 286406. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}